{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvUmV2aWV3LSUyOFRWLVNlcmllcy0yMDE0LSUyOS8","type":"series","name":"Review","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/igseZf0ClaW0kzqnAIORuXjNxkR.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dr8oooQY5BJuHihzk6JihNiOrdW.jpg","description":"A review of a movie, or a restaurant, or a car—or whatever else that typically falls under a critic's domain—is all well and good, and can even be helpful at times. But how can one find out about myriad other experiences that are never tackled in reviews? Enter Forrest MacNeil, a critic who goes beyond overviews of life's more-common subjects—way beyond—to satisfy the curiosity of others: The adrenaline rush of stealing; the danger of drug addiction; the delight of sleeping with a celebrity. MacNeil tries anything suggested by viewers of his TV show, then presents a 1-to-5-star review. But his unwavering commitment to experiencing intense adventures means he must deal with the unintended consequences of such a goal.","releaseInfo":"2014","genres":["English"],"videos":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvUmV2aWV3LSUyOFRWLVNlcmllcy0yMDE0LSUyOS8.1.1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"episode":1,"released":"2002-09-28T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvUmV2aWV3LSUyOFRWLVNlcmllcy0yMDE0LSUyOS8.1.2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"episode":2,"released":"2002-09-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvUmV2aWV3LSUyOFRWLVNlcmllcy0yMDE0LSUyOS8.1.3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2002-09-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvUmV2aWV3LSUyOFRWLVNlcmllcy0yMDE0LSUyOS8.1.4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2002-10-01T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGh